</office:automatic-styles>
<office:body><office:text><text:h text:outline-level="1">HengDesk Knowledge Base Quarterly Report</text:h><text:p>This report summarizes knowledge base usage in the third quarter, including ingested documents, retrieval hit rate and user satisfaction.</text:p><text:p>For access control the system applies a pre-filter so that users can only retrieve chunks from documents they are allowed to read.</text:p><text:p>Next quarter we plan to add incremental indexing and automatic expiry to reduce the cost of rebuilding indexes.</text:p><table:table table:name="T1"><table:table-column table:number-columns-repeated="4"/><table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Department</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Docs</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Queries</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Hit rate</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row><table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Finance</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>1204</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>35210</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>92.4%</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row><table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Legal</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>876</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>12045</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>88.1%</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row><table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>R&amp;D Center</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>5310</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>98022</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>95.7%</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row></table:table><text:section text:style-name="Sect2" text:name="S2"><text:p>Left column: multi-column layouts are common in journals and official documents, and a parser must emit text in reading order.</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Brk">Right column: if a parser merges the same line of both columns, chunk semantics break and vector retrieval recall suffers.</text:p></text:section><text:h text:outline-level="1">HengDesk Knowledge Base Quarterly Report</text:h><text:p>This report summarizes knowledge base usage in the third quarter, including ingested documents, retrieval hit rate and user satisfaction.</text:p><text:p>For access control the system applies a pre-filter so that users can only retrieve chunks from documents they are allowed to read.</text:p><text:p>Next quarter we plan to add incremental indexing and automatic expiry to reduce the cost of rebuilding indexes.</text:p><table:table table:name="T1"><table:table-column table:number-columns-repeated="4"/><table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Department</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Docs</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Queries</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Hit rate</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row><table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Finance</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>1204</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>35210</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>92.4%</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row><table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>Legal</text:p></table:table-cell